WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
TrialPilot compares trial choices with visible assumptions and evidence. This is a real
local API demo.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Import BOREAS from cached ClinicalTrials.gov data. Registry facts and missing inputs
stay distinct.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Review 19 protocol candidates with pages and quotations. This cached transcription is
not measured live LLM accuracy.

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Bulk acceptance is recorded as review activity. Applying the protocol saves a new design
version; it does not establish clinical approval.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Inspect cost, site hours, patient travel, duration and carbon. These ranges depend on
model assumptions.

6
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Change hypothetical monitoring and supply inputs. Screen results and the saved scenario
remain bound to the same design version.

7
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Forecast and supply expose their actual draw counts. Inspect stockout risk and warnings
alongside modeled waste.

8
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Open carbon provenance: formulas, activity inputs, direct and upstream factors, and
explicit assumptions. Model precision is not empirical accuracy.

9
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Save the computed scenario and its version. A pending calculation cannot be saved as if
it were current.

10
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:43.000
The real API blocks self-approval: authors cannot approve their own work.

11
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Riley demonstrates the independent reviewer role, binding a signature to the saved
record hash.

12
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Sam demonstrates QA approval of this scenario. These fictional automated signatures are
not human approval of the software or validation report.

13
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Verify the current audit chain and inspect events. This prototype still needs production
identity and security controls.

14
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Open the 40-site synthetic feed. Its operational signals demonstrate software behavior,
not real clinical activity.

15
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Acknowledge overstock, assign an intervention and start it. The action and owner are
recorded.

16
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Advance six simulated weeks. Inspect treated and control changes, the effect interval
and its assumptions; this does not prove causation.

17
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:51.000
Engine/library gaps are +23.38% for CASPS and +22.75% for PRIMETIME, excluding drug
supply. Module gaps remain.

18
00:02:51.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Tested code e5c386b: 576 passed, zero failed. Download the actual evidence. The report
remains awaiting human QA approval.
